1
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:05,603
Okay. "Now holding sides of hearth
in position...

2
00:00:05,805 --> 00:00:09,105
...Iower mantelpiece assembly
onto top tabs."

3
00:00:11,444 --> 00:00:14,314
(Leonard:)Look at that, I built a fireplace
with my own two hands.

4
00:00:15,215 --> 00:00:16,545
(Penny:)You're so butch.

5
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:19,547
(Leonard:)Aw, I got a little paper cut.

6
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:22,809
(Penny:)Of course you did.
You're hands are softer than veal.

7
00:00:24,524 --> 00:00:28,464
Oh, uh, before I forget, Saturday I'm planning
a Dungeons & Dragons night with the guys.

8
00:00:28,628 --> 00:00:31,098
(Penny:)That's how you're gonna spend
your Saturday night?

9
00:00:31,264 --> 00:00:34,254
- Come on, I hardly get a chance to play.
- You poor thing.

10
00:00:34,434 --> 00:00:36,734
Is having a real girlfriend
who has sex with you...

11
00:00:36,903 --> 00:00:39,273
(Penny:)...getting in the way
of your board games?

12
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,140
A little bit, yeah.

13
00:00:43,877 --> 00:00:47,037
Oh, great, I've always wanted to play
Dungeons & Dragons.

14
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:50,153
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm sorry,
I should've mentioned this earlier.

15
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:51,480
(Sheldon:)You're not invited.

16
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,980
(Amy:)Why not?

17
00:00:55,155 --> 00:00:59,485
(Sheldon:)Amy, from time to time,
we men need to break free...

18
00:00:59,659 --> 00:01:05,789
(Sheldon:)...from the shackles of civility and get
in touch with our primal, animalistic selves.

19
00:01:06,299 --> 00:01:09,569
(Amy:)By rolling dice and playing make-believe
with little figurines?

20
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:11,796
(Sheldon:)Like a bunch of savages.

21
00:01:14,007 --> 00:01:16,407
(Penny:)Saturday night?
But I've been working late all week.

22
00:01:16,576 --> 00:01:20,236
(Bernadette:)- That was gonna be our night.
- I have to go, we play as a group.

23
00:01:20,413 --> 00:01:23,503
And if I'm not there,
then everyone will blame you.

24
00:01:23,683 --> 00:01:27,413
They'll be all, "Bernadette ruined
everything. She's the worst."

25
00:01:28,988 --> 00:01:33,788
So you see, heh,
I have to play Dungeons & Dragons.

26
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,790
(Howard:)For the marriage.

27
00:01:36,796 --> 00:01:38,666
(Bernadette:)You're an idiot.

28
00:01:39,899 --> 00:01:43,999
(Howard:)I'm your idiot. Forever.

29
00:01:44,504 --> 00:01:48,494
(Raj:)So listen, I know we talked about
getting a bite to eat in Silver Lake...

30
00:01:48,675 --> 00:01:51,205
(Raj:)...then seeing the Christmas lights
in Griffith Park...

31
00:01:51,411 --> 00:01:55,351
(Raj:)...but Leonard's talking about
a big D and D game at his place.

32
00:01:55,515 --> 00:01:57,945
(Stuart:)Saturday night just went
from crazy to epic.

33
00:01:58,118 --> 00:02:00,038
(Stuart:)Woo-hoo!

